    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it’s not just \"feeling this way.\" it’s like, there was a reason i'm still here and they aren't. it feels like i stole my life from them. i look at my parents or my friends and i just see how much they’re hurting, and i know i'm just another thing they have to worry about. i'm just a constant reminder of what they lost. wouldn't it be easier for everyone if i just wasn't part of the equation anymore?",
